        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona wa muntu yambaye impuzu zera, yari hejuru y’amazi y’urwo ruzi, amanika ukuboko kw’i buryo n’ukw’ i bumoso, ayatunga mw ijuru; numva arahira Ībaho ibihe bitazoshira, yuko bizomara igihe n’ibihe n’igice c’igihe; kand’ ati Ni bamara guca ubgoko bgera ubunywenywe, ivyo vyose bizoba bishize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
